    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSituated on the outskirts of Borrisokane town, this well-maintained three-bedroom bungalow offers comfortable accommodation in a private yet convenient location, within easy walking distance of the town's amenities and facilities.\n\nThe property has been carefully maintained and benefits from attractive, well-established gardens to both the front and rear.\n\nInternally, the accommodation comprises an entrance hall leading to a well-proportioned living room at the front of the property. The living room provides access to a spacious sitting/dining area featuring a solid-fuel inset stove, which in turn is open to the kitchen, creating a bright and practical living space.\n\nThere are three bedrooms, all benefiting from built-in wardrobes, along with two spacious bathrooms. The property also includes a shower area and utility space.\n\nWith its convenient location, generous accommodation and private gardens, this property would make an ideal first-time buyer's home, retirement property or family residence."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - 1.22e c 0.6d\nTiled\n\nEntrance Hall - 1.467w x 3.379d\nTiled\n\nLiving Room - 4.42w z 3.792d\nOpen fire, Window to front\n\nSitting Room - 4.458w x 3.217d\nSolid Fuel Inset Stove, timber floor\n\nKitchen/Dining - 3.552w x 2.915d\nTimber ceiling, tiled flooring\n\nWC - 1.7w x 0.780d\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.109w x 3.085d\nBuilt in Wardrobe, Carpet\n\nFamily Bathroom - 1.540w x 2.9d\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.775w x 2.930d\nBuilt in Wardrobe, Carpet\n\nWet Room - 3.789w x 1.9d\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.146w x 3.679d\nBuilt in wardrobe.\n\nShower Room - 2.216w z 0.785d\n\n\nUtility Room to Rear - 1.870w x 1.710d\nPlumbed for washing machine\n\nDetached Garage - 8.4w x 3.689d\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
